### Pro1X: every resume of the sound card pops in the loudspeaker (codec and
### amplifier power-up). Suspend only after 5 minutes of silence instead of 5 s.
### Kernel patch 0026 (7.1.0-pro1x.8) should fix the pop. Once the test in
### docs/audio.md passes on the phone, use the 3 s line instead (the N9 used
### 1-5 s); the card open for 5 minutes costs about 100 mA.
.ifexists module-suspend-on-idle.so
unload-module module-suspend-on-idle
load-module module-suspend-on-idle timeout=300
#load-module module-suspend-on-idle timeout=3
.endif
